@startuml
title Web page embedding
' Traces: OMCT-C09-L2-04.03
actor Operator
participant "Angular Shell" as Shell
participant "Web Page View" as View
participant "Browser Frame" as Frame

Operator -> Shell: navigate(webPageObject)
activate Shell
Shell -> View: render(webPageObject)
activate View
View -> View: readConfiguredUrl(object)
View -> Frame: createFrame(url)
activate Frame
Frame --> View: embedded page frame
deactivate Frame
View --> Shell: frame rendered
Shell --> Operator: web page object shown
deactivate View
deactivate Shell
@enduml
